<main id="content" class="site-main post mt-article"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">7 Reasons Why Custom Water Walls Are Popular</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p class="mt-article-meta"><time datetime="2020-12-04T12:05:53">December 4, 2020</time></p><figure class="mt-article-hero"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/7-Reasons-Why-Custom-Water-Walls-Are-Popular-jpg.avif" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/7-Reasons-Why-Custom-Water-Walls-Are-Popular-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/7-Reasons-Why-Custom-Water-Walls-Are-Popular-jpg-50x50.avif 50w, /wp-content/uploads/7-Reasons-Why-Custom-Water-Walls-Are-Popular-jpg.avif 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px" width="768" height="427" alt="7-Reasons-Why-Custom-Water-Walls-Are-Popular" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><div class="mt-article-body"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" crossorigin="anonymous" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-37329" src="/wp-content/uploads/7-Reasons-Why-Custom-Water-Walls-Are-Popular.jpg" alt="Todays custom water features have long surpassed tabletop fountains and are Esther Williams-worth creations. Some that are over 30-foot installations of water cascading over the glass to choreographed bubble walls with color-changing LED lights. Midwest Tropical provides water walls whose customization is only limited by your imagination. They are available in all sizes, materials, and shapes, including granite slabs and mosaic glass tiles. If youre contemplating custom water walls, then by the end, youll have made up your mind, so continue reading to find out why theyre the trendiest human creation of the century. 1. Create a personalized architectural statement Theres only so much that wall murals and decoration pieces can do when trying to make a statement. With a custom wall waterfall that is tailored to your theme, you can create a personal statement that reflects on your working style and leaves an imprint that people are not likely to forget. 2. Elite styles Water wall features offer you a chance to establish an elite style with convenience. Whether its made of glass or granite slabs, you can go modern-chic or urban that blends well with the rest of your decor. 3. Adorn empty spaces and long corridors Filling up empty spaces can be daunting when choosing what goes where. Instead of shopping around for pieces that will grow old soon, invest in a water wall that will not only fill the space but create a focal point that attracts people no matter how many times theyve seen it. With just this one piece, you can ensure that every corner of your commercial space sparks interest. 4. Visual Aesthetics Theres no denying the allure of custom water features, but the value they bring to the aesthetics is incomparable to all others. Midwest Tropicals water features give you the opportunity to enhance your visual beauty while bringing all their other benefits like bonus points. 5. Growing trends of minimalism While the world grows conscious of useless consumerism, theres a growing trend towards minimalism. By adopting this mindset, you can create a space where focus and devotion are your priority. With a water wall installation, youre letting go of all extra stuff that will give an aura of an organized mind that realizes whats actually essential to bring results. 6. The Calming Sense of Natural Elements Staying indoors for most of our day takes a toll on our bodies that is overlooked until it turns into chronic pain or depression. By bringing in natural elements indoors, you give yourself and your employees a chance to breathe in fresh air while calming their minds with the soothing trickling sounds of wall waterfalls. 7. Brand identity and awareness A custom water feature can be the most effective canvas to display your brand logo and create awareness. People will always know that this breathtaking visual and its many benefits are brought by whom. Its a name that will make an impression forever and may inspire others to take the same steps. There are many forms of custom water features, such as bubble walls and rain curtains that are compatible with all types of themes and vibes. Midwest Tropical is your ultimate partner with whom you can trust to manifest your vision right down to a T. Stand out from the crowd and let people know what you stand for and what your values are with a water wall." width="1000" height="556" title=""></p>
<p>Todays custom water features have long surpassed tabletop fountains and are Esther Williams-worth creations. Some that are over 30-foot installations of water cascading over the glass to choreographed bubble walls with color-changing LED lights. <strong><em>Midwest Tropical</em></strong> provides water walls whose customization is only limited by your imagination. They are available in all sizes, materials, and shapes, including granite slabs and mosaic glass tiles. If youre contemplating custom water walls, then by the end, youll have made up your mind, so continue reading to find out why theyre the trendiest human creation of the century.</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Create a personalized architectural statement</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Theres only so much that wall murals and decoration pieces can do when trying to make a statement. With a custom wall waterfall that is tailored to your theme, you can create a personal statement that reflects on your working style and leaves an imprint that people are not likely to forget.</p>
<ol start="2">
<li><strong>Elite styles</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Water wall features offer you a chance to establish an elite style with convenience. Whether its made of glass or granite slabs, you can go modern-chic or urban that blends well with the rest of your decor.</p>
<ol start="3">
<li><strong>Adorn empty spaces and long corridors</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Filling up empty spaces can be daunting when choosing what goes where. Instead of shopping around for pieces that will grow old soon, invest in a water wall that will not only fill the space but create a focal point that attracts people no matter how many times theyve seen it. With just this one piece, you can ensure that every corner of your commercial space sparks interest.</p>
<ol start="4">
<li><strong>Visual </strong><strong>Aesthetics</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Theres no denying the allure of custom water features, but the value they bring to the aesthetics is incomparable to all others. <strong><em>Midwest Tropicals</em></strong> water features give you the opportunity to enhance your visual beauty while bringing all their other benefits like bonus points.</p>
<ol start="5">
<li><strong>Growing trends of minimalism</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>While the world grows conscious of useless consumerism, theres a growing trend towards minimalism. By adopting this mindset, you can create a space where focus and devotion are your priority. With a water wall installation, youre letting go of all extra stuff that will give an aura of an organized mind that realizes whats actually essential to bring results.</p>
<ol start="6">
<li><strong>The Calming Sense of Natural Elements</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>Staying indoors for most of our day takes a toll on our bodies that is overlooked until it turns into chronic pain or depression. By bringing in natural elements indoors, you give yourself and your employees a chance to breathe in fresh air while calming their minds with the soothing trickling sounds of wall waterfalls.</p>
<ol start="7">
<li><strong>Brand identity and awareness</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>A custom water feature can be the most effective canvas to display your brand logo and create awareness. People will always know that this breathtaking visual and its many benefits are brought by whom. Its a name that will make an impression forever and may inspire others to take the same steps.</p>
<p>There are many forms of custom water features, such as bubble walls and rain curtains that are compatible with all types of themes and vibes. Midwest Tropical is your ultimate partner with whom you can trust to manifest your vision right down to a T. Stand out from the crowd and let people know what you stand for and what your values are with a water wall.</p>
</div></div></main>

